1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,057
Put n equal to three.

2
00:00:02,057 --> 00:00:08,997
Factorise z cubed minus one: z minus one, times z squared plus z plus one.

3
00:00:08,997 --> 00:00:17,656
So one root is one, and the quadratic gives the other two: minus one plus or minus i root three, over two.

4
00:00:17,656 --> 00:00:19,192
Call the first omega.

5
00:00:19,192 --> 00:00:21,549
The other is omega squared.

6
00:00:21,549 --> 00:00:26,302
On the diagram, they are an equilateral triangle on the unit circle.

